# Judge10-11-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:絶望して諦めてしまえば、<br>その瞬間<br>全ての可能性は潰える。|#0205Trial11_Hiro001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だが、<br>わずかな可能性であっても<br>それに向かって進む限り、<br>希望は潰えない……！|#0205Trial11_Hiro002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:諦めるのは、<br>すべてが無理であると<br>わかってからでも<br>遅くはない……。|#0205Trial11_Hiro003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それが【正しい道】だ！|#0205Trial11_Hiro004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL10,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……なら、<br>その具体的な方法を<br>教えてちょうだい。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL10,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あなたは魔女因子を<br>取り除くというけれど……。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Closed2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなこと、<br>本当にできるのかしら。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……メルルの話では、<br>大魔女はその身を<br>魔女因子に変えた。|#0205Trial11_Hiro005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:なら、<br>大魔女を再び<br>この世に顕現させれば<br>その構成要素だった魔女因子が<br>還元されるはずだ。|#0205Trial11_Hiro006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:その結果、<br>君の姉が【なれはて】から<br>元に戻る可能性だってある……！|#0205Trial11_Hiro007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL8,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:【魔女化させた少女を集めて、<br>大魔女を復活させる】……。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……まるで邪教の儀式ね。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Smile_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……Ｂ級ホラーでも<br>見ないような、<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_11_01\">ありがち</link>なストーリーだわ。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"あなたもその大魔女とやらに<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_11_02\">操られている</link>だけ<br>じゃないの？|#0205Trial11_Nanoka007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……たしかに、<br>大魔女は<br>人類への復讐を<br>目論んでいる。|#0205Trial11_Hiro008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それでも、<br>私たちが救われるには<br>この道しかないんだ……！|#0205Trial11_Hiro009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"大魔女を復活させて、<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_11_03\">お願い</link>でもするのかしら？|#0205Trial11_Nanoka008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あなたの示す道は……<br>タチの悪い幻覚だわ。|#0205Trial11_Nanoka009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


